{"id":"nuca","lemma":"nuca","pos":"noun","rank":4697,"glosses":["nape (back of the neck)"],"ipa":"/ˈnuka/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"nucas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/7a/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-nuca.wav","examples":[{"text":"Él tiene ojos en la nuca.","en":"He has eyes at the back of his head.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1195677","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"eye","l":"ojo"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"Una pelota me pegó en la nuca mientras jugaba fútbol.","en":"A ball hit the back of my head while I was playing soccer.","words":[{"g":"a"},{"g":"ball"},{"g":"me"},{"g":"to stick","l":"pegar"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"while, whilst, as"},{"g":"to play","l":"jugar"},{"g":"football"}]}]}